          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የእስራኤል ፡ ፈጣሪ ፡ አባቶቻችንን ፡ መር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጧቸዋል ፡ እንደ ፡ መረጣቸው ፡ ዕወቁ ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአዕበዮሙ ፡ ለሕዝቡ ፡ በኀበ ፡ አፍለሶሙ ፡ በም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድረ ፡ ግብፅ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተሰደው ፡ በሄዱበት ፡ አገር ፡ በግብፅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አበዛቸው ፡ እንዳበዛቸው ፡ ዕወቁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወበመዝራዕቱ ፡ ልዑል ፡ አውፅኦሙ ፡ እምህየ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጽኑ ፡ ሥልጣኑ ፡ ከግብፅ ፡ አወጣቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘጠኝ ፡ መቅሠፍት ፡ ዐሥረኛ ፡ ሞተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኵር ፡ አድርጎ ፡ እንዳወጣቸው ፡ ዕወቁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢሳ ፡ ፩ ፡ ፪ ። ዘፀአ ፡ ፲፪ ፡ ፴፯ ፡ ፵፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፰ ፤ ⟪ወሴሰዮሙ ፡ በገዳም ፡ አርብዓ ፡ ዓመተ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አርባ ፡ ዘመን ፡ መና ፡ ከደመና ፡ እያወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረደ ፡ ውኃ ፡ ከደንጊያ ፡ እያፈለቀ ፡ መገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
