          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባቸው ፡ ዘፀአ ፡ ፲፮ ፡ ፴፭ ። ዘኍል ፡ ፲፬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፬ ። ዘዳግ ፡ ፩ ፡ ፴፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፱ ፤ ⟪ወአእተተ ፡ ሰብዐተ ፡ አሕዛበ ፡ ከነዓን ፡ ወአ",
